Weather Data Analysis and Prediction

This project focuses on analyzing historical weather data and forecasting future temperatures using time series analysis and machine learning techniques. It's an excellent project for learning data preprocessing, visualization, feature engineering, and predictive modeling.

Project Objectives
Analyze historical weather patterns.
Identify seasonal and long-term temperature trends.
Predict future temperatures using regression or time-series models.
Visualize weather trends and forecast results.
